      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"journey-story color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme | default: 'scheme-1' }} gradient\">\n\n  <style>\n    .journey-story {\n      padding: 4rem 2rem;\n    }\n\n    .journey-story__inner {\n      max-width: var(--page-width);\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .journey-story__content {\n      max-width: 76rem;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.15);\n      padding-bottom: 4rem;\n    }\n\n    .journey-story__heading {\n      margin: 0 0 3rem;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: var(--font-heading-family);\n      font-style: var(--font-heading-style);\n      font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight);\n      font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.8rem);\n      line-height: 1.1;\n      color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));\n    }\n\n    .journey-story__content p {\n      margin: 0 0 2rem;\n      font-family: var(--font-body-family);\n      font-style: var(--font-body-style);\n      font-weight: var(--font-body-weight);\n      font-size: 1.6rem;\n      line-height: 2;\n      color: rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.8);\n    }\n\n    .journey-story__highlight {\n      color: #FB58A9;\n    }\n\n    .journey-story__pullquote {\n      margin: 4rem 0;\n      padding: 2rem 0 2rem 2rem;\n      border-left: 2px solid #FB58A9;\n    }\n\n    .journey-story__pullquote p {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: var(--font-heading-family);\n      font-style: var(--font-heading-style);\n      font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight);\n      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 3vw, 3.8rem);\n      line-height: 1.25;\n      color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));\n    }\n\n    @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n\n      .journey-story {\n        padding: 3rem 1.5rem;\n      }\n\n      .journey-story__content {\n        max-width: 100%;\n      }\n\n      .journey-story__heading {\n        font-size: 3rem;\n      }\n\n      .journey-story__content p {\n        font-size: 1.5rem;\n        line-height: 1.9;\n      }\n\n      .journey-story__pullquote {\n        padding-left: 1.6rem;\n      }\n\n      .journey-story__pullquote p {\n        font-size: 2.4rem;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <div class=\"journey-story__inner\">\n    <div class=\"journey-story__content\">\n\n      <h2 class=\"journey-story__heading\">\n        Our Journey\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        La Concheria didn't start as a café.\n      </p>\n\n      <p>\n        It started with a family — a dad, a daughter, and a son — loading up cookies and knocking on doors across the Rio Grande Valley. Tortillerías, meat markets, local stores. At their peak, their cookies were sitting on shelves in <span class=\"journey-story__highlight\">80 locations.</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <p>\n        Then came a storefront. Then partners. Then betrayal.\n      </p>\n\n      <p>\n        Profits were stolen. Debt piled up. The business they had built from nothing was gone. They were broke — and starting over wasn't a plan, it was a last resort.\n      </p>\n\n      <blockquote class=\"journey-story__pullquote\">\n        <p>\n          With five maxed-out credit cards and nothing but each other, they opened a small coffee shop in McAllen, Texas and called it La Concheria.\n        </p>\n      </blockquote>\n\n      <p>\n        No investors. No safety net. Just authentic conchas, honest chilaquiles, and a family that refused to quit.\n      </p>\n\n      <p>\n        The Valley showed up — fast. Within two months, the café was turning a profit. Within six months, they opened a second location. What started as a desperate bet had become something real, something growing, something the community claimed as their own.\n      </p>\n\n      <p>\n        Then came the moment that stopped them in their tracks — PBS's Daytripper, hosted by Chet Garner, walked through their doors. He watched the conchas being made by hand, the same way they've always been made, and brought La Concheria's story to audiences across the entire state of Texas.\n      </p>\n\n      <p>\n        Four years. Two states of mind — rock bottom and rising. Eighty store shelves, five credit cards, two locations, and one visit from Daytripper later —\n      </p>\n\n      <blockquote class=\"journey-story__pullquote\">\n        <p>\n          La Concheria is what happens when family refuses to quit.\n        </p>\n      </blockquote>\n\n      <p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n        We're glad you found us.<br>\n        Pull up a chair. The conchas are fresh.\n      </p>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</section>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
